[00:42.23]I know you've seen the billowy black
[00:47.56]You have been blinded by the gleam
[00:51.30]And then your sight came back
[00:55.55]
[01:02.37]You sent smoke into the sky
[01:04.88]And you breathed it back
[01:09.31]
[01:22.91]Oh, but I saw what you dont see
[01:29.87]I saw tiny lights and mountainous peaks
[01:36.82]
[01:41.20]I saw your future in my sleep
[01:57.72]